{"type":"message","id":"ffaa6b5d","parentId":"6c810c28","timestamp":"2026-07-30T03:04:41.044Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Docker Desktop 无法启动，MCP 服务不可用。我需要告知用户这个情况，并建议手动处理小红书内容推送任务。"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n❌ **推送失败 — Docker Desktop 未启动**\n\n**原因：** 小红书 MCP 服务（xiaohongshu-mcp）运行在 Docker 容器中，但 Docker Desktop 当前无法启动，导致 MCP 服务连接超时。\n\n**影响：** 无法自动获取小红书旅游热度内容和生成封面图。\n\n**解决方法（需要手动）：**\n1. 打开 Docker Desktop，等待启动完成\n2. 启动容器：`docker start xiaohongshu-mcp`\n3. 确认容器运行：`docker ps | findstr xiaohongshu`\n4. 重新触发任务，或手动运行脚本\n\n**如果 Docker 一直无法启动**，可能需要重启电脑或检查 WSL/Docker Desktop 状态。\n\n请处理后告知，我再重新执行推送。\n</final>"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1785380674158}}
